{"about_the_game":"<strong>&quot;Kingdom Ascension&quot; is a medieval-themed strategy war game. You will become a lord and build your own territory from scratch. Through resource collection, building construction, troop recruitment, exploration and adventure, you will continue to expand your territory and defend your homeland</strong><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3330160/extras/1y.png?t=1750835999\" /></div><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3330160/extras/f8d608a1de5049431d5f2627972b6c4c.poster.webp?t=1750835999\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3330160/extras/f8d608a1de5049431d5f2627972b6c4c.webp?t=1750835999\" class=\"bb_img\" /></picture></div><br><strong>Starting from a desolate base, collect key resources such as food and materials. In the case of limited resources, you need to be prudent and reasonably allocate resources for troop training, building upgrades and technology research and development to lay the foundation for development. </strong><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3330160/extras/3y.png?t=1750835999\" /></div><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3330160/extras/ec4a5eaa77921fcacd5bc6eb6faddba4.poster.webp?t=1750835999\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3330160/extras/ec4a5eaa77921fcacd5bc6eb6faddba4.webp?t=1750835999\" class=\"bb_img\" /></picture></div><br><strong>Develop the technology tree to improve economic efficiency and scale. Focus on upgrading the performance and role of war equipment. These key skills 